This is a loop construct.

If you happened to have got a _magic_ potion, then
repeat to create another random potion from the set of _physical_ potions
       (according to an implicit implementation dependent order)
       which are { booze, sickness, fruit, acid, oil, water }
until you've got one that is not sickness (in this case).

Note: if the first check for a magical potion fails, it may as well be a
potion of sickness.

